{
  "version": "1",
  "questId": "fr_08",
  "lang": "ar",
  "lines": [
    {
      "key": "000fc05",
      "nodeTitle": "item_hat",
      "sourceText": "مع القبعة، لن تشعر بالبرد في رأسك.",
      "sourceEnText": "With a hat, your head won't get cold.",
      "audioFile": "fr_08_000fc05.mp3",
      "voiceProfile": "haytham",
      "actorId": "Default",
      "durationMs": 2847,
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-24T23:52:47Z",
      "textHash": "f0135b82017fae630fabbb9ab6dcf08054480b9f3044510e5f7f1646beac4aac"
    },
    {
      "key": "001e940",
      "nodeTitle": "npc_base4",
      "sourceText": "أجب عن ثلاثة أسئلة حول الجبل.",
      "sourceEnText": "Answer three questions about the mountain.",
      "audioFile": "fr_08_001e940.mp3",
      "voiceProfile": "haytham",
      "actorId": "Default",
      "durationMs": 2247,
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-24T23:53:20Z",
      "textHash": "a4281f35af60c7f95f280fdde93d38f6e58346fe70388340cb283f768ef46b27"
    },
    {
      "key": "003e87c",
      "nodeTitle": "chest_bonus",
      "sourceText": "إليك وشاح دافئ وجميل! خذه!",
      "sourceEnText": "Here's a nice warm scarf! Take it!",
      "audioFile": "fr_08_003e87c.mp3",
      "voiceProfile": "haytham",
      "actorId": "Default",
      "durationMs": 2534,
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-24T23:53:41Z",
      "textHash": "9d25d5c30c597cb2a3a8fc4418ad122ad7faa865525494c8024a8a422d65ff72"
    },
    {
      "key": "003ecb2",
      "nodeTitle": "spawned_tourist",
      "sourceText": "مون بلان هو أعلى جبل في فرنسا.",
      "sourceEnText": "Mont Blanc is the highest mountain in France.",
      "audioFile": "fr_08_003ecb2.mp3",
      "voiceProfile": "haytham",
      "actorId": "ADULT_F",
      "durationMs": 2900,
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-24T23:53:45Z",
      "textHash": "90234046009cb226fe64cef72d75437d59c92222223f62fc47288392de90074a"
    },
    {
      "key": "00a7e83",
      "nodeTitle": "npc_base3",
      "sourceText": "بالضبط!",
      "sourceEnText": "Exact ! ",
      "audioFile": "fr_08_00a7e83.mp3",
      "voiceProfile": "haytham",
      "actorId": "Default",
      "durationMs": 993,
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-24T23:53:10Z",
      "textHash": "b405dab6780cfb828e1e69a8ba823d6fc9c964ad834e7db469665093828483e3"
    },
    {
      "key": "011dc7e",
      "nodeTitle": "spawned_tourist",
      "sourceText": "أحب الجبال. وأنت؟",
      "sourceEnText": "I love the mountains. And you?",
      "audioFile": "fr_08_011dc7e.mp3",
      "voiceProfile": "haytham",
      "actorId": "ADULT_F",
      "durationMs": 2011,
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-24T23:53:44Z",
      "textHash": "260f6be886970de9e4a1ac463018b0db094c8689c27c38ca91ecd28767097778"
    },
    {
      "key": "015bf8a",
      "nodeTitle": "npc_base1",
      "sourceText": "أنت الآن جاهز. يمكنك الذهاب إلى قمة مونت بلانك!",
      "sourceEnText": "Now you're ready. You can go to the summit of Mont Blanc!",
      "audioFile": "fr_08_015bf8a.mp3",
      "voiceProfile": "haytham",
      "actorId": "Default",
      "durationMs": 4702,
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-24T23:52:35Z",
      "textHash": "3f9551a97b0d48906cd2ddcd1ef653b10971cfa84d7bde3edd261cc7c2df4e35"
    },
    {
      "key": "018880a",
      "nodeTitle": "npc_base4",
      "sourceText": "يبلغ ارتفاع قمة مونت بلانك 4807 أمتار.",
      "sourceEnText": "The summit of Mont Blanc is 4807 meters high.",
      "audioFile": "fr_08_018880a.mp3",
      "voiceProfile": "haytham",
      "actorId": "Default",
      "durationMs": 4519,
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-24T23:53:19Z",
      "textHash": "5e30ca3f6273dabefe340965792f34bfbd7723381be415a1320529f632398e52"
    },
    {
      "key": "01a4b20",
      "nodeTitle": "npc_base3",
      "sourceText": "سعف النخيل",
      "sourceEnText": "palm fronds",
      "audioFile": "fr_08_01a4b20.mp3",
      "voiceProfile": "haytham",
      "actorId": "Default",
      "durationMs": 1280,
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-24T23:53:11Z",
      "textHash": "b5512c90863a5a0125da163e9010d9114cc0b2715d6b2eccc4861105a7ce027e"
    },
    {
      "key": "01beb5e",
      "nodeTitle": "npc_intro",
      "sourceText": "صعد الكلب إلى الجبال ومعه أغراضك.",
      "sourceEnText": "The dog went up into the mountains with your things.",
      "audioFile": "fr_08_01beb5e.mp3",
      "voiceProfile": "haytham",
      "actorId": "Default",
      "durationMs": 2952,
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-24T23:52:23Z",
      "textHash": "17f2bd3bcdad10e85754b3141df648fbae718e73204b752ae0a212e9f79c00d2"
    },
    {
      "key": "01e5f66",
      "nodeTitle": "spawned_hiker",
      "sourceText": "هل سبق لك أن صنعت رجل ثلج؟",
      "sourceEnText": "Have you ever made a snowman?",
      "audioFile": "fr_08_01e5f66.mp3",
      "voiceProfile": "haytham",
      "actorId": "ADULT_M",
      "durationMs": 2351,
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-24T23:53:55Z",
      "textHash": "bd860701a3084bbbe775f68259a6d301a807d2910400872e0af8f943bae4b5d2"
    },
    {
      "key": "029a03e",
      "nodeTitle": "npc_base2",
      "sourceText": "الشمس والثلج يؤذيان عينيك. أنت بحاجة إلى نظارة شمسية.",
      "sourceEnText": "The sun and snow hurt your eyes. You need sunglasses.",
      "audioFile": "fr_08_029a03e.mp3",
      "voiceProfile": "haytham",
      "actorId": "Default",
      "durationMs": 5172,
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-24T23:52:53Z",
      "textHash": "c9c04e95760b159684d3c08e0f3015d1ac3277381eb2eb355a8b0cfb6f9d3800"
    },
    {
      "key": "029f39c",
      "nodeTitle": "item_backpack",
      "sourceText": "والآن اذهب إلى الجبال. ابحث عن ملابس دافئة ومعدات جبلية.",
      "sourceEnText": "Now go to the mountains. Find warm clothes and mountain gear.",
      "audioFile": "fr_08_029f39c.mp3",
      "voiceProfile": "haytham",
      "actorId": "Default",
      "durationMs": 5303,
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-24T23:52:34Z",
      "textHash": "5530f20dcbb4ca948d75168a954ae4e7c5257694f0a2d68efc55d1b84ac82637"
    },
    {
      "key": "02a2ea9",
      "nodeTitle": "item_sunglasses",
      "sourceText": "في الجبال، تؤذي الشمس والثلج العيون",
      "sourceEnText": "In the mountains, the sun and snow hurt the eyes",
      "audioFile": "fr_08_02a2ea9.mp3",
      "voiceProfile": "haytham",
      "actorId": "Default",
      "durationMs": 3448,
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-24T23:53:03Z",
      "textHash": "88712b68dc654f5f08c3ee14a00689dca76db41f3d763fdf16b79f9f4372617b"
    },
    {
      "key": "02a3874",
      "nodeTitle": "snowman_1",
      "sourceText": "لا شكراً، سأبقى هنا.",
      "sourceEnText": "No thanks, I'll stay here.",
      "audioFile": "fr_08_02a3874.mp3",
      "voiceProfile": "haytham",
      "actorId": "Default",
      "durationMs": 2142,
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-24T23:53:36Z",
      "textHash": "0c53a73aa2ba7a7fa01addc56ee1b54e38044f4d41675c5a0e050cc74f59ae2f"
    },
    {
      "key": "02c9805",
      "nodeTitle": "activity_3_done",
      "sourceText": "افتح الصندوق لتحصل على المرابط!",
      "sourceEnText": "Open the chest to get crampons!",
      "audioFile": "fr_08_02c9805.mp3",
      "voiceProfile": "haytham",
      "actorId": "Default",
      "durationMs": 3082,
      "updatedAt": "2026-03-15T12:26:23Z",
      "textHash": "f0cd59041f74a8f65a3178e1dcaa99a49c59fdfd6e37e5bac71227d6ef1f847b"
    },
    {
      "key": "030fa1c",
      "nodeTitle": "npc_base4",
      "sourceText": "أحسنت! لقد وصلت إلى قمة مونت بلانك.",
      "sourceEnText": "Well done! You've reached the summit of Mont Blanc.",
      "audioFile": "fr_08_030fa1c.mp3",
      "voiceProfile": "haytham",
      "actorId": "Default",
      "durationMs": 3448,
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-24T23:53:17Z",
      "textHash": "12df9dc805cc2cf3b45a05aa4f7bc2365c446063de749a70ceb24eff9a753700"
    },
    {
      "key": "035e68a",
      "nodeTitle": "snowman",
      "sourceText": "المعسكر الأساسي 4",
      "sourceEnText": "Basecamp 4",
      "audioFile": "fr_08_035e68a.mp3",
      "voiceProfile": "haytham",
      "actorId": "Default",
      "durationMs": 2612,
      "updatedAt": "2026-03-15T12:26:44Z",
      "textHash": "39d8b367667ae90804c3d62905af33e6152a0ae3ec46fb0f080d574c9cdcd938"
    },
    {
      "key": "0371d31",
      "nodeTitle": "spawned_alps_climber",
      "sourceText": "يمكن أن يرافقك مرشد جبلي.",
      "sourceEnText": "A mountain guide can come with you.",
      "audioFile": "fr_08_0371d31.mp3",
      "voiceProfile": "haytham",
      "actorId": "ADULT_F",
      "durationMs": 2351,
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-24T23:53:59Z",
      "textHash": "81db8565123d257b02dae3b1a28a26bd7fea3d9c427d8316e0ac2ec90456f3e0"
    },
    {
      "key": "038d1bc",
      "nodeTitle": "item_rope",
      "sourceText": "يُتيح لك الحبل البقاء آمناً على الجليد والصخور.",
      "sourceEnText": "The rope allows you to be safe on ice and rocks.",
      "audioFile": "fr_08_038d1bc.mp3",
      "voiceProfile": "haytham",
      "actorId": "Default",
      "durationMs": 3448,
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-24T23:53:16Z",
      "textHash": "e1ebbe722f529b48809d3329672f5dd33736f2ca1be8d417df8dc7393450c370"
    },
    {
      "key": "03db010",
      "nodeTitle": "npc_swiss",
      "sourceText": "تقع سويسرا شمال مونت بلانك.",
      "sourceEnText": "Switzerland is north of Mont Blanc.",
      "audioFile": "fr_08_03db010.mp3",
      "voiceProfile": "haytham",
      "actorId": "Default",
      "durationMs": 2247,
      "updatedAt": "2026-03-15T16:40:53Z",
      "textHash": "770f7fc1aacb3e9f91115c6c1463d1e8e47e86b523af5e1f23a4a3e78bb254ab"
    },
    {
      "key": "03dd802",
      "nodeTitle": "npc_base1",
      "sourceText": "ليس لديك معطف. اذهب وابحث عنه!",
      "sourceEnText": "You don't have a coat. Go find it!",
      "audioFile": "fr_08_03dd802.mp3",
      "voiceProfile": "haytham",
      "actorId": "Default",
      "durationMs": 3605,
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-24T23:52:38Z",
      "textHash": "ef8024b0d19d9206f4acfbaac37156a6ac4cb7e2207d1ef337bf3cca14388078"
    },
    {
      "key": "045409f",
      "nodeTitle": "npc_intro",
      "sourceText": "أولاً، أنت بحاجة إلى حقيبة ظهر.",
      "sourceEnText": "First, you need a backpack.",
      "audioFile": "fr_08_045409f.mp3",
      "voiceProfile": "haytham",
      "actorId": "Default",
      "durationMs": 2900,
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-24T23:52:26Z",
      "textHash": "30db674f9021e1b50724317a615c8e176100ec0bba42854d63bf46c82e0e7bb3"
    },
    {
      "key": "046eb33",
      "nodeTitle": "npc_intro",
      "sourceText": "عد عندما تجده.",
      "sourceEnText": "Come back when you've found it.",
      "audioFile": "fr_08_046eb33.mp3",
      "voiceProfile": "haytham",
      "actorId": "Default",
      "durationMs": 1541,
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-24T23:52:20Z",
      "textHash": "5ed502dae8357232ffc896bcdd4316f9478b8403ede179469fcbf7acb77738ab"
    },
    {
      "key": "04bbada",
      "nodeTitle": "spawned_tourist",
      "sourceText": "انظر جيدًا! سترى حيوان المرموط.",
      "sourceEnText": "Look closely! You're going to see a marmot.",
      "audioFile": "fr_08_04bbada.mp3",
      "voiceProfile": "haytham",
      "actorId": "ADULT_F",
      "durationMs": 2978,
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-24T23:53:47Z",
      "textHash": "62d62c9b8fff8a7a99036382091d50ecf180007efd5f1939400ba49ca22e3d64"
    },
    {
      "key": "04c1c1f",
      "nodeTitle": "npc_intro",
      "sourceText": "لديك حقيبة ظهرك. الآن اذهب وأحضر ملابسك الدافئة ومعدات تسلق الجبال.",
      "sourceEnText": "You have your backpack. Now go get your warm clothes and mountain gear.",
      "audioFile": "fr_08_04c1c1f.mp3",
      "voiceProfile": "haytham",
      "actorId": "Default",
      "durationMs": 6191,
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-24T23:52:16Z",
      "textHash": "6f7ad0977250bbf4199aaee1b4724e93f63a218db5e490d58faa7d7ca8d605df"
    },
    {
      "key": "050fe70",
      "nodeTitle": "npc_italy",
      "sourceText": "تقع إيطاليا شرق جبل مونت بلانك.",
      "sourceEnText": "To the East of Mont Blanc there is Italy.",
      "audioFile": "fr_08_050fe70.mp3",
      "voiceProfile": "haytham",
      "actorId": "Default",
      "durationMs": 2769,
      "updatedAt": "2026-03-15T12:26:39Z",
      "textHash": "7cefbfb813074504ac41e71e11c027fbff2fafc6be2dfa00f5dec29f439033aa"
    },
    {
      "key": "0557ef5",
      "nodeTitle": "spawned_hiker",
      "sourceText": "يوجد ثلج في الجبال.",
      "sourceEnText": "There is snow in the mountains.",
      "audioFile": "fr_08_0557ef5.mp3",
      "voiceProfile": "haytham",
      "actorId": "ADULT_M",
      "durationMs": 1646,
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-24T23:53:52Z",
      "textHash": "d02eccf4e6f5630407143fcb1055f50be31fc83ec1276b0f9f82db68f8da2a43"
    },
    {
      "key": "056ec2b",
      "nodeTitle": "chest_base1",
      "sourceText": "يُفتح الصندوق! ويحتوي على بعض المعدات.",
      "sourceEnText": "The chest opens! It contains some equipment.",
      "audioFile": "fr_08_056ec2b.mp3",
      "voiceProfile": "haytham",
      "actorId": "Default",
      "durationMs": 3500,
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-24T23:52:44Z",
      "textHash": "8d87652fa05ed95ed38f01e34b658b950fb1fb8dcbb0303c1b6c372c0c428f43"
    },
    {
      "key": "058bb65",
      "nodeTitle": "snowman",
      "sourceText": "المعسكر الأساسي 3",
      "sourceEnText": "Basecamp 3",
      "audioFile": "fr_08_058bb65.mp3",
      "voiceProfile": "haytham",
      "actorId": "Default",
      "durationMs": 1829,
      "updatedAt": "2026-03-15T12:26:44Z",
      "textHash": "4a0228edf9d8c1e8bccd30b449c4cfc6d9f16beb150d481ad035ca6fa4b4ecca"
    },
    {
      "key": "0590129",
      "nodeTitle": "spawned_tourist",
      "sourceText": "للوصول إلى قمة مونت بلانك، خذ معك ملابس دافئة.",
      "sourceEnText": "To go to the summit of Mont Blanc, take warm clothes.",
      "audioFile": "fr_08_0590129.mp3",
      "voiceProfile": "haytham",
      "actorId": "ADULT_F",
      "durationMs": 4571,
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-24T23:53:48Z",
      "textHash": "af8081f58d3d53d090dd07e97f4cad014f89dd15fbf7cbcbeffb495a79a41964"
    },
    {
      "key": "059d744",
      "nodeTitle": "item_hat",
      "sourceText": "القبعة تحميك من الرياح.",
      "sourceEnText": "The hat protects you from the wind.",
      "audioFile": "fr_08_059d744.mp3",
      "voiceProfile": "haytham",
      "actorId": "Default",
      "durationMs": 2011,
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-24T23:52:48Z",
      "textHash": "945434f444afca47ac314ec72d0188207487e1a2b42b1e2ca831acc3d32b8178"
    },
    {
      "key": "05cabb5",
      "nodeTitle": "npc_intro",
      "sourceText": "افتح الصندوق لتجد حقيبة الظهر!",
      "sourceEnText": "Open the chest to find the backpack!",
      "audioFile": "fr_08_05cabb5.mp3",
      "voiceProfile": "haytham",
      "actorId": "Default",
      "durationMs": 2612,
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-24T23:52:28Z",
      "textHash": "946e2df71c522638173e371005613f83d0c5e2fcefe8a664e45dfabf3a891814"
    },
    {
      "key": "05e3658",
      "nodeTitle": "snowman",
      "sourceText": "المعسكر الأساسي 2",
      "sourceEnText": "Basecamp 2",
      "audioFile": "fr_08_05e3658.mp3",
      "voiceProfile": "haytham",
      "actorId": "Default",
      "durationMs": 1541,
      "updatedAt": "2026-03-15T12:26:43Z",
      "textHash": "b5b5dee2f5bd6f9c4fd4e9d43a63bc82e36fec19c2b4523894c4b1b45a09a6cd"
    },
    {
      "key": "05e80cb",
      "nodeTitle": "item_backpack",
      "sourceText": "تحتوي حقيبة الظهر على الماء والطعام والخريطة.",
      "sourceEnText": "In the backpack, there is water, food, and a map.",
      "audioFile": "fr_08_05e80cb.mp3",
      "voiceProfile": "haytham",
      "actorId": "Default",
      "durationMs": 3683,
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-24T23:52:32Z",
      "textHash": "f010e9d18fa6ffa9435b589aaff4fecc837b7c96a7be69375292cf2133be75cc"
    },
    {
      "key": "0650acc",
      "nodeTitle": "npc_intro",
      "sourceText": "ابحث عن ملابس دافئة ومعدات جبلية.",
      "sourceEnText": "Find warm clothing and mountain gear.",
      "audioFile": "fr_08_0650acc.mp3",
      "voiceProfile": "haytham",
      "actorId": "Default",
      "durationMs": 3500,
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-24T23:52:25Z",
      "textHash": "37d3f2abdc14e36ed138b5f029d92fcb20a1b08d5e0d307bdcb3d1587adbaa1c"
    },
    {
      "key": "06b15bb",
      "nodeTitle": "npc_base3",
      "sourceText": "لديك معدات تسلق الجبال. محاولة أخيرة للوصول إلى القمة.",
      "sourceEnText": "You have your mountain gear. One last effort to reach the summit.",
      "audioFile": "fr_08_06b15bb.mp3",
      "voiceProfile": "haytham",
      "actorId": "Default",
      "durationMs": 4989,
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-24T23:53:06Z",
      "textHash": "e4ae10a698d9af9a31b223a878e4e4b15b85e89af8a076053ed9de8a4767574c"
    },
    {
      "key": "06b3363",
      "nodeTitle": "npc_base2",
      "sourceText": "ليس لديك أي قفازات!",
      "sourceEnText": "You don't have any gloves!",
      "audioFile": "fr_08_06b3363.mp3",
      "voiceProfile": "haytham",
      "actorId": "Default",
      "durationMs": 1724,
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-24T23:52:52Z",
      "textHash": "104b53f3dbec8e594d0a3ac2938b228e6afd7dbd8b538675a90307bfd0702236"
    },
    {
      "key": "06d9f34",
      "nodeTitle": "npc_base3",
      "sourceText": "للمشي على جليد الأنهار الجليدية، نحتاج إلى معدات خاصة.",
      "sourceEnText": "To walk on glacier ice, we need special gear.",
      "audioFile": "fr_08_06d9f34.mp3",
      "voiceProfile": "haytham",
      "actorId": "Default",
      "durationMs": 4937,
      "updatedAt": "2026-03-15T12:26:18Z",
      "textHash": "23a5a23ab935d5c26126fcd231c840ad0e5cedcf59b6a907a1b104c2279c3fe2"
    },
    {
      "key": "06f9a2a",
      "nodeTitle": "question_alps",
      "sourceText": "في أي سلسلة جبال يقع جبل مونت بلانك؟",
      "sourceEnText": "What mountain range is Mont Blanc in?",
