    {
      "key": "end_1",
      "nodeTitle": "quest_end",
      "sourceText": "أحسنت! لقد وصلت إلى قمة مونت بلانك. يبلغ ارتفاعها 4807 أمتار. إنها أعلى جبل في فرنسا.",
      "sourceEnText": "Well done! You've reached the summit of Mont Blanc. It measures 4807 meters. It's the highest mountain in France.",
      "audioFile": "fr_08_end_1.mp3",
      "voiceProfile": "haytham",
      "actorId": "Default",
      "durationMs": 10136,
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-24T23:52:11Z",
      "textHash": "ece79ba7a65421be3b30b877e25105c1e7fd3b9d0f669001584d7e427f0d4d5c"
    },
    {
      "key": "end_2",
      "nodeTitle": "quest_end",
      "sourceText": "توجد في جبال الألب العديد من الجبال الكبيرة والجميلة.",
      "sourceEnText": "In the Alps, there are many large and beautiful mountains.",
      "audioFile": "fr_08_end_2.mp3",
      "voiceProfile": "haytham",
      "actorId": "Default",
      "durationMs": 3971,
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-24T23:52:13Z",
