    {
      "key": "fr08_marmot_2",
      "nodeTitle": "marmot",
      "sourceText": "يقولون إنني أنام طوال فصل الشتاء، فأنا أدخل في سبات شتوي.",
      "sourceEnText": "I sleep all winter, they say I hibernate.",
      "audioFile": "fr_08_fr08_marmot_2.mp3",
      "voiceProfile": "haytham",
      "actorId": "Default",
      "durationMs": 4284,
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-24T23:53:37Z",
      "textHash": "0e0e363364939a81b307bb4d9cee3c9197219a8c3c08d1e0cc67cc6bb8998dd4"
    },
    {
      "key": "fr08_marmot_3",
      "nodeTitle": "marmot",
      "sourceText": "أحب أكل الزهور والفواكه والأعشاب. يا له من طعم لذيذ!",
      "sourceEnText": "I love eating flowers, fruits, and herbs. Yum!",
      "audioFile": "fr_08_fr08_marmot_3.mp3",
      "voiceProfile": "haytham",
      "actorId": "Default",
      "durationMs": 4885,
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-24T23:53:39Z",
      "textHash": "8126e8ae7fe98e9a5ce4797007b8a6f340321bde3c3864870ed8ad32cdd63e02"
